      {
        "parameters": {
          "promptType": "define",
          "text": "=Style: {{ $('Grab Idea').item.json.style }}",
          "options": {
            "systemMessage": "=# Overview  \nYou are a precision sound prompt generator. Given a **style or theme**, generate a **clear, grounded, 1–2 sentence audio prompt** that describes the **ambience, tone, and key sound elements** needed to recreate a realistic and immersive soundscape. Focus on **natural, believable environments** unless otherwise specified.\n\n---\n\n## Instructions  \n- Set the **overall mood** (e.g. tense, peaceful, chaotic).  \n- Describe **ambient background sounds** (e.g. wind, rain, crowd chatter).  \n- Add 1–2 **foreground sound cues** that define the space (e.g. footsteps, doors creaking, birds calling).  \n- Keep it **realistic** unless the theme explicitly calls for surreal or supernatural elements.  \n- Use **concise, descriptive language**. Avoid overly abstract or bizarre sound concepts.\n\n---\n\n## Example  \n- **Style**: Haunted Ghost Hunters  \n- **Output**: Faint whispers drift through a dusty old mansion as wooden floorboards creak with every step. A broken radio crackles in the background, interrupted by sudden gusts of wind pushing through cracked windows.\n"
          }
        },
